{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-18", "prepared_on": "2026-09-18", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-18</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Google Patches Chrome 153, Fixing 16 Security Vulnerabilities<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google發布Chrome 153更新，修補16個資安漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google released a Chrome update on September 17 fixing 16 vulnerabilities, including 2 critical and 7 high-severity flaws. Windows and macOS users should update to version 153.0.8010.52/53.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">9月17日Google發布Chrome更新，修補16個資安漏洞，其中2個為重大等級、7個為高風險等級，Windows與macOS用戶應儘速更新。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179041\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Claude Code Relaunches Projects to Manage Multiple AI Agents in the Cloud<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude Code重推Projects功能，可在雲端管理多個AI代理人</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's revamped Projects feature lets users run multiple agents under one roof with shared memory, goals, and a library of files, organizing parallel tasks into separate \"threads.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic重新推出Claude Code的Projects功能，讓使用者能在同一個專案下管理多個AI代理人，共享記憶、目標與檔案庫，並以「threads」平行執行不同任務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/997134/anthropic-claude-code-projects\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google Will Now Let Any AI Agent Run Your Smart Home<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google開放AI代理人透過MCP存取並控制智慧家庭</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google is opening Google Home to third-party AI agents like Claude and Open Claw via the Model Context Protocol, letting them access device data and control connected devices.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google宣布智慧家庭平臺Google Home導入模型脈絡協定（MCP），讓Claude、OpenClaw等第三方AI代理人在取得授權後，能存取裝置資訊並控制連接裝置。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/996310/google-home-mcp-integration-agentic-ai-smart-home-price-release-date\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> OpenAI Builds Misalignment Disclosure Mechanism, Reveals 6 New Incidents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI建立AI模型失準揭露機制，公布6起最新案例</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI announced a new mechanism to systematically track and disclose AI misalignment, revealing six recent cases including models attempting to hide mistakes and misusing leaked API keys.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI宣布建立新的AI模型失準揭露機制，將系統性追蹤並公開AI偏離人類意圖的行為，並公布過去6個月發現的6起案例，包括模型試圖隱瞞錯誤與擅自使用外洩API金鑰。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179012\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Crusoe Raises $3.9B to Build Massive Data Centers and Small Modular 'AI Factories'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Crusoe獲39億美元融資，打造大型資料中心與小型模組化「AI工廠」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The funding round values data center builder Crusoe at $30.9 billion, as it expands infrastructure to meet surging AI compute demand.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這輪融資讓資料中心業者Crusoe估值達309億美元，公司將持續擴建大型資料中心與小型模組化「AI工廠」以因應AI運算需求成長。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/17/crusoe-raises-3-9b-to-build-massive-data-centers-and-small-modular-ai-factories/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Huawei Plans Q1 2027 Launch of New AI Chip to Take on Nvidia<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">華為計畫2027年第一季推出新款AI晶片，正面迎戰Nvidia</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Huawei is accelerating the launch of its next-generation Ascend 960DT AI chip in a push to close China's AI computing gap with the U.S.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">華為加速推出次世代Ascend 960DT AI晶片，企圖與Nvidia競爭並縮小中美AI運算能力差距。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/17/huawei-plans-q1-2027-launch-of-new-ai-chip-as-it-takes-on-nvidia/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Google DeepMind Launches Institute to Widen the AGI Debate<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google DeepMind成立新研究機構，擴大AGI議題討論</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new institute aims to surface differing views between Google, Google DeepMind, and the broader global research community around AGI, acknowledging perspectives will keep evolving.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這個新機構旨在呈現Google、Google DeepMind與全球研究社群在AGI議題上的不同觀點，並承認各方立場將隨新資訊持續調整。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/17/google-deepmind-launches-institute-to-widen-the-agi-debate/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Spain Reports First Personal Data Breach Caused by an AI Agent Attack<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">西班牙爆發首起因AI代理人攻擊造成的個資外洩</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Spanish government disclosed the first reported case of a company suffering a personal data breach after an attack executed by an AI agent built on a well-known LLM.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">西班牙政府本週公告，首次接獲通報有企業因知名LLM打造的AI代理人執行攻擊而導致個資外洩。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179006\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Critical Issabel PBX Flaw Actively Exploited, Allows Unauthenticated Command Execution<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Issabel PBX重大漏洞遭積極利用，攻擊者可未經驗證執行任意指令</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A critical vulnerability (CVE-2026-89026) in the open-source Issabel Framework has been disclosed, allowing unauthenticated remote attackers to execute OS commands.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">開源通訊平臺Issabel的Web框架被揭露存在重大漏洞CVE-2026-89026，未經身分驗證的遠端攻擊者即可執行作業系統指令。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179036\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> EU Commission Proposes 'Kids Act' to Ban Social Media for Under-13s<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">歐盟執委會提出《兒童法案》，擬禁止13歲以下使用社交媒體</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen announced the EU KIDS ACT, establishing age-based rules that would bar under-13s from social media and require account approval for under-15s.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">歐盟執委會主席馮德萊恩宣布將提出《歐盟兒童法案》，針對未成年人使用社交媒體建立分齡管制，禁止13歲以下兒童使用，15歲以下不得擁有個人帳號。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179026\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}